    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Previous Findings\"\nsubtitle: \"Convergence between locus|gene pairs reported on this analysis and previously reported colocalizations (BigBrain, Bellenguez and SingleBrain papers).\"\nformat:\n  html:\n    page-layout: full\nexecute:\n  echo: false\n  warning: false\n  message: false\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div>\n<div class=\"kpi-box\">\n<span class=\"num\">123</span>\n<span class=\"lab\">Loci on the table</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kpi-box\">\n<span class=\"num\">58</span>\n<span class=\"lab\">with literature reports to compare</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kpi-box\">\n<span class=\"num\">83%</span>\n<span class=\"lab\">concordance</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"kpi-box\">\n<span class=\"num\">65</span>\n<span class=\"lab\">no previous register (new or non-audited loci)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Overview\n\n\n::: {.cell layout-align=\"center\"}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](previous_findings_files/figure-html/euler-1.png){fig-align='center' width=768}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n*Overlap = loci where at least one gene nominated here was also reported in the literature (concordant). \"This study\" alone = loci reported in the literature, but with no gene in common (discordant). \"Literature\" alone = loci with a previous report that did not reach significance here. The isolated bubble holds loci with no literature counterpart at all.*\n\n## Full table\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"datatables html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-3a54d7ea7bcfebe7e839\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-3a54d7ea7bcfebe7e839\">{\"x\":{\"filter\":\"top\",\"vertical\":false,\"filterHTML\":\"<tr>\\n  <td data-type=\\\"character\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: top;\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"form-group has-feedback\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: auto;\\\">\\n      <input t